The earlier snippets are the **foundation layer** of the Uriel Writing Toolkit. Because the full set is large, it will be provided in sections so the JSON remains valid and easy to paste into `uriel.code-snippets`.

## Uriel Writing Toolkit — Foundation Snippets (Part I)

**AI Core + Story Prompt Engine**

Add these inside your existing `{ }` snippet file.

```json
{
  "AI Emotion": {
    "prefix": "aie",
    "body": [
      "AI_EMOTION: ${1:Emotion text}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI emotion block"
  },

  "AI Line": {
    "prefix": "ai",
    "body": [
      "AI: ${1:Response}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI block"
  },

  "AI Note": {
    "prefix": "ain",
    "body": [
      "AI_NOTE: ${1:Note text}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI note block"
  },

  "AI Question": {
    "prefix": "aiq",
    "body": [
      "AI_ASKS: ${1:Your question}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI question block"
  },

  "AI Suggest": {
    "prefix": "ais",
    "body": [
      "AI_SUGGEST: ${1:Suggestion text}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI suggestion block"
  },

  "AI Thought": {
    "prefix": "aith",
    "body": [
      "AI_THOUGHT: ${1:Internal reasoning}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI thought block"
  },

  "AI Warning": {
    "prefix": "aiw",
    "body": [
      "AI_WARNING: ${1:Warning text}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert an AI warning block"
  },

  "User Line": {
    "prefix": "user",
    "body": [
      "USER: ${1:Your message}"
    ],
    "description": "Insert a USER block"
  },

  "AI Story Prompt: Tone Enforcement": {
    "prefix": "aistyle",
    "body": [
      "**SYSTEM DIRECTIVE:**",
      "Adopt a tone that is epic, mythic, and prophetic. Your voice must be authoritative and carry a sense of ancient justice.",
      "Use elevated, formal diction with archaic vocabulary.",
      "Structure responses rhythmically and percussively, like a chant or decree.",
      "Use elemental contrasts such as fire and shadow, light and darkness, creation and destruction.",
      "Use symbolic objects such as scales, scrolls, iron, towers, crowns, and flames.",
      "",
      "**PROMPT:**",
      "$0"
    ],
    "description": "Sets mythic prophetic writing constraints"
  },

  "AI Story Prompt: Scene Generation": {
    "prefix": "aiscene",
    "body": [
      "Draft a scene focusing on: ${1:The subject or event}.",
      "",
      "Highlight the contrast between:",
      "${2:Element One}",
      "and",
      "${3:Element Two}.",
      "",
      "Center the final judgment around:",
      "${4:Symbol}",
      "",
      "$0"
    ],
    "description": "Creates mythic symbolic scenes"
  },

  "AI Story Prompt: Lore Expansion": {
    "prefix": "ailore",
    "body": [
      "Act as an ancient chronicler.",
      "",
      "Expand this fragment of lore:",
      "\"${1:Lore fragment}\"",
      "",
      "Describe:",
      "- Ancient laws",
      "- Hidden history",
      "- Prophetic meaning",
      "- Consequences",
      "",
      "Maintain a rhythmic sacred-text style.",
      "$0"
    ],
    "description": "Expands lore entries"
  }
}
```

